      Source_Contribution:
        This was the original map that was scanned and later
        georeferenced.
    Process_Step:
      Process_Description:
        The source map was originally scanned at 400 dots per inch
        (DPI) by staff of the NOAA National Geodetic Survey.
        Each scanned T/TP-Sheet was georeferenced to the earth's
        surface using ERDAS Imagine image processing software.  An
        accuracy report showing the amount of Root Mean Square
        (RMS) error for each link was generated and available for
        review.  The program evaluated the amount of error and
        prompted the user to delete any coordinate link pairs that
        exceeded the RMS threshold as set by National Map Accuracy
        Standards.
      Process_Date: 20060123
      Process_Contact:
        Contact_Information:
          Contact_Organization_Primary:
