            Postal_Code: 29405
            Country: USA
          Contact_Voice_Telephone: (843)740-1295
          Contact_Facsimile_Telephone: (843)740-1224
          Contact_Electronic_Mail_Address: csc@csc.noaa.gov
          Hours_of_Service:
            Monday through Friday, 8 a.m. to 5 p.m.,
            Eastern Standard Time
    Process_Step_Citation:
      Users interested in the methods used during the
      georeferencing process can refer to the training
      manual developed by the NOAA Coastal Services
      Center.  This manual is available on their
      shoreline data web site for free download and is
      saved in Adobe .pdf format.
      http://www.csc.noaa.gov/products/shorelines
